<title>USA: April paper Brent dips in late U.S. trading.</title>
<headline>April paper Brent dips in late U.S. trading.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>North Sea Brent dipped in late U.S. paper trading, traders said.</p>
<p>A full cargo of April Brent changed hands at $19.55 a barrel, down one cent from the IPE settlement.</p>
<p>Several partial cargoes moved at the same level.</p>
<p>March/April Brent traded at plus 43 cents, at the low end of this afternoon's range after trading at plus 51 cents earlier in the day.</p>
<p>An April/May spread traded at plus 33 cents, within the day's range.</p>
<p>--Patricia Garip-Bertuol NY Energy Desk ((+1 212 859 1620))</p>
